# A rule 4 rebuild outside the MAIN checkout writes here instead of over the
# tracked manifest. The binaries are per-tree and untracked because
# link_worktree.py does not link vendor/exoplasim; the record describing them
# has to be per-tree too, or a worktree's rebuild commits a manifest that
# travels on merge while the binaries do not, and leaves the main checkout's
# executables with provenance unknown. world-s6wz.
binary_manifest.local.json
